# Core line-ending rule for this repo: the files below are read inside a Linux container, and
# a CRLF shebang line ("#!/bin/sh\r") makes the entrypoint fail with "no such file or
# directory" on a host that checks out with core.autocrlf=true. Pinning eol=lf means the same
# clone builds correctly from Windows, macOS or the VM itself.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker/* text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
deploy/compose.env.example text eol=lf
